dh-uprising-title = Uprising
dh-uprising-description = A district of Lost Angels: the Military Police hunts the LFFC cells hiding among the residents, LA-V does business with both sides.
dh-star-system-angels-prosperity = Angels Prosperity
dh-celestial-angels-prosperity-star = Angels Prosperity
dh-celestial-angels-prosperity = Angels Prosperity
dh-celestial-angels-prosperity-desc = The capital world of the United Republic. Lost Angels, the largest city of mankind, covers half of the continent.
dh-chat-radio-la-police = Military Police
dh-chat-radio-la-front = Front
dh-chat-radio-la-vanguard = LA-V
dh-uprising-flight-name = Aeronautics flight
dh-uprising-sender-city = Lost Angels City Hall
dh-uprising-sender-aeronautics = LZ-1 Aeronautics
dh-uprising-flight-incoming = A flight lands at LZ-1 Aeronautics in { $minutes } min and stays for { $stay } min. Military Police reinforcements arrive with it; LA-V passengers may board.
dh-uprising-flight-landed = The flight has landed at LZ-1 Aeronautics. Departure in { $minutes } min.
dh-uprising-flight-departed = The flight has left LZ-1 Aeronautics.
dh-uprising-flight-departed-vip = The flight has left LZ-1 Aeronautics with { $names } aboard.
dh-uprising-time-up = Curfew: the Republic sends the army into the district. The uprising is over — for today.
dh-uprising-briefing-civilian = You are a resident of a Lost Angels district. The Military Police and the Front are fighting in your streets. Survive, work, and decide whom to trust.
dh-uprising-briefing-police = You are the Republican Military Police. LFFC cells are hiding among the residents: find and arrest or eliminate their squad leaders. Do not shoot civilians — every civilian killed counts against you.
dh-uprising-briefing-front = You are a fighter of the Liberation Front of Free Colonies. Hide among the residents, follow your squad leader and hold the district. The Independent Colonies armed you; your radio is on your ear.
dh-uprising-briefing-front-leader = You are an LFFC squad leader. Lead your cell: keep the district, strike the factory or broadcast the manifesto. If you are caught or killed, the uprising fails. The Independent Colonies armed you; your radio is on your ear.
dh-uprising-briefing-vanguard = You work for Lost Angels—Vanguard. The corporation sells to whoever pays. Protect the office and the representative.
dh-uprising-briefing-vanguard-vip = You are the LA-V representative in the district. Do business with both sides and get out alive: board the flight at LZ-1 Aeronautics (next in { $minutes } min).
dh-uprising-end-front = The district stays with the Front: { $free } of { $leaders } LFFC squad leaders remain free.
dh-uprising-end-police = The Military Police broke the uprising: every LFFC squad leader was arrested or killed.
dh-uprising-end-no-leaders = The uprising had no squad leaders.
dh-uprising-end-vip-evacuated = The LA-V representative got out through LZ-1 Aeronautics.
dh-uprising-end-vip-stayed = The LA-V representative did not get out.
dh-uprising-end-forces = Free and alive: Military Police { $police }, Front { $front }.
dh-uprising-end-civilians = Civilians killed: { $total } (by the Military Police: { $police }, by the Front: { $front }).
